nd very round through the face, torso, and limbs, with a heavy belly and small feet."}, {"id": "public_leaders_characters_brew_master_cheerful_expression", "label": "Cheerful closed-eye smile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/leaders/characters/brew_master.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "rationale": "Round tan face with closed curved eyes, a small nose, and a slight smile."}, {"id": "public_leaders_characters_brew_master_orange_headband", "label": "Orange headband", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/leaders/characters/brew_master.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "rationale": "A bright orange band is tied across the forehead, with a small knot or fold at the front center."}, {"id": "public_leaders_characters_brew_master_gray_rounded_mass", "label": "Large gray rounded mass behind the head", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/leaders/characters/brew_master.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "rationale": "A soft gray-lavender mass, wider than the shoulders, sits behind and above the head. Highlights make it look fluffy or cloth-like. What it is remains a separate uncertain reading."}, {"id": "public_leaders_characters_brew_master_hair_or_sack", "label": "Hair bun or carried sack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/leaders/characters/brew_master.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.2, "rationale": "The gray mass can be read as a huge gray hair bun or as a cloth sack carried behind the head. The pink-and-green mark could be